  "title": "A Proof-Carrying Exclusion Through Length 18 for the 3-out-of-5 Picture-Hanging Word",
  "batch_label": "本地文献跟进",
  "kind": "result-note",
  "original_status": "unresolved",
  "scope": "For the 3-out-of-5 picture-hanging problem in the free group F_5 as defined in source.md and interpreted in problem.md, no admissible element has reduced length at most 18. Hence L(3,5) >= 20. The explicit independently checked length-26 element also gives L(3,5) <= 26, so the certified window is 20 <= L(3,5) <= 26. This is a strict subsidiary bound and does not determine the exact value requested by the original problem.",
